20260529.113713.074 [<ideas.........] [test`, so it only processes a prefix of checks (kiss/ruff/clippy). In contrast, the agent claims success based on the full]
20260529.113713.305 [<ideas.........] [128-second pipeline. If clippy diverges between shells, a retry occurs even if the agent eventually passes.]
20260529.113714.294 [<ideas.........] [2.]
20260529.113714.434 [<ideas.........] [**Sandbox zombie quorum**  The agent session reports 0 GiB sandbox at g2 start, yet during g1 it had 9861580 MiB RSS with 10]
