20260529.113714.960 [<ideas.........] [**Mutable checks specification / dual gate universes**  The `.malvin/checks` file is an editable artifact, and `cd rust &&]
20260529.113715.161 [<ideas.........] [cargo clippy` differs from the agents repo-root or prompt-embedded gate commands; thus, the agents reported "cargo clippy]
